Scope and disclaimer

This license covers the nes2msxtr tools, runtime, test ROMs, documentation and
the boot picture in assets/. It does not cover NES game images, nor the
cartridges nes2msxtr builds from them: those contain code and graphics
translated from the original game and remain the property of its copyright
holders. Only convert games you own and have the right to convert, and do not
distribute the results.

nes2msxtr is a non-profit, fan-made, unofficial project. It is NOT affiliated
with, authorized, maintained, sponsored, or endorsed by Nintendo Co., Ltd.,
Konami Group Corporation, Arc System Works Co., Ltd., or any of their
affiliates or subsidiaries. All registered trademarks, logos, game titles,
characters, and related assets are the sole property of their respective
owners. NES is a trademark of Nintendo; MSX is a trademark of MSX Licensing
Corporation. No copyright infringement is intended.
